WEBVTT

00:03.020 --> 00:04.770
<b>That-There Park</b>

00:12.150 --> 00:14.360
What's wrong, Nishimura-san?

00:14.360 --> 00:15.290
Oh...

00:15.280 --> 00:18.660
<b>Please adopt me</b>

00:15.610 --> 00:18.180
Whoa, where'd you get a kitty?!

00:19.230 --> 00:20.970
W-Well...

00:20.970 --> 00:22.870
I found it over there.

00:23.490 --> 00:26.050
Huh, you think someone abandoned it?

00:27.590 --> 00:29.010
It's so cute!

00:30.900 --> 00:31.960
See?

00:34.070 --> 00:36.540
I... I...

00:36.540 --> 00:39.300
I-If it was abandoned, I...

00:39.300 --> 00:41.100
want to keep it!

00:41.870 --> 00:44.170
Nishimura-san, just calm down.

00:45.130 --> 00:46.850
It's adorable!

00:46.850 --> 00:48.560
Its fur is pure black.

00:48.940 --> 00:52.490
Lucky you! Nishimura-san 
says she'll take you in.

00:52.490 --> 00:54.190
I felt the same way.

00:54.190 --> 00:56.800
You and Nishimura-san are 
perfect for each other.

01:00.410 --> 01:02.670
What's the matter, Nishimura-san?

01:02.670 --> 01:06.590
N-Nothing. It's not a big deal...

01:07.150 --> 01:10.190
It's just that, if the kitty's with me,

01:10.190 --> 01:14.360
I feel like people will also
 call it sinister or unlucky...

01:14.980 --> 01:17.230
That'd be really sad.

01:18.690 --> 01:21.740
Just think of Kitagawa-kun and the others.

01:24.310 --> 01:27.320
That's because Kitagawa-kun 
can't stand curses.

01:27.770 --> 01:29.220
Unlike me.

01:29.220 --> 01:30.400
Still...

01:32.000 --> 01:33.240
You're not unlucky.

01:33.810 --> 01:34.670
Huh?

01:35.490 --> 01:40.480
I spend more time with you than anyone,
 and I'm so happy every day!

01:40.480 --> 01:42.610
I'm sure this kitty will be just fine.

01:43.330 --> 01:44.360
Yeah...

01:46.740 --> 01:48.740
Besides, take a look!

01:50.240 --> 01:53.400
He has every bit of your cuteness!

01:53.400 --> 01:54.190
What?!

01:54.620 --> 01:56.700
The spitting image!

01:56.700 --> 01:58.170
He really is cute!

01:58.170 --> 02:00.040
It's cuteness overload!

02:00.510 --> 02:02.040
Y-Yeah...

02:02.500 --> 02:04.640
There's no doubting he's cute.

02:04.970 --> 02:05.640
See?

02:05.640 --> 02:09.030
He's super cute, just like you,
 Nishimura-san!

02:09.030 --> 02:11.650
What do we have in common? Hair color?

02:18.100 --> 02:21.170
H-He really is a cutie.

02:21.170 --> 02:24.170
Nishimura-san, you've got 
a huge grin on your face.

03:51.040 --> 03:55.000
My <b>Clueless</b> First Friend

03:55.790 --> 04:00.800
<i>Episode 3 "Summer Vacation Begins"</i>

04:01.370 --> 04:04.790
Nishimura-san's cat is so stinkin' cute.

04:04.790 --> 04:07.880
W-We decided to name it Kuro.

04:08.180 --> 04:10.310
Hey, did you see that?

04:10.310 --> 04:14.360
So Nishimura-san got a pet cat, huh?

04:14.360 --> 04:17.100
It's pure black, perfect for the Grim Reaper.

04:17.390 --> 04:18.630
That's right.

04:18.630 --> 04:21.300
They say that pets take after their owners.

04:22.490 --> 04:24.430
So you think so, too?!

04:24.430 --> 04:25.100
Huh?

04:25.550 --> 04:27.850
She's saying you're cute, Nishimura-san.

04:27.850 --> 04:28.720
Good for you.

04:28.720 --> 04:29.410
What?

04:29.410 --> 04:30.910
I didn't say that at all!

04:30.910 --> 04:33.480
But pets take after their owners, right?

04:33.480 --> 04:34.570
Well, I did say that.

04:34.570 --> 04:37.260
In other words, Nishimura-san is cute!

04:37.260 --> 04:39.080
I didn't say <i>that</i>!

04:39.080 --> 04:43.870
If pets take after their owners, 
then isn't that what you meant?

04:43.870 --> 04:47.000
We never said that cat was 
cute in the first place.

04:47.760 --> 04:52.010
Well, I think we're talking 
the cutest in the world, Nishimura-san!

04:52.010 --> 04:53.090
R-Right.

04:53.090 --> 04:55.900
The cat, right? You mean Kuro, right?

04:55.900 --> 04:59.030
Takada-kun sure is kinda weird.

04:59.030 --> 05:01.790
Neither of them is very cute.

05:01.790 --> 05:03.650
Right, Kasahara-san?

05:05.550 --> 05:07.460
It's so adorable!

05:07.460 --> 05:08.740
Kasahara-san?!

05:09.780 --> 05:11.330
How old is your cat?!

05:12.920 --> 05:14.770
Do you have any videos?!

05:16.650 --> 05:18.820
D-Do you like cats?

05:19.340 --> 05:20.770
<i>Seriously?</i>

05:21.420 --> 05:24.350
My apartment doesn't allow pets...

05:24.350 --> 05:26.580
Cats are the one thing I can't resist!

05:26.830 --> 05:29.070
These pics are precious, too!

05:29.070 --> 05:30.790
D-Do you have any more?

05:30.790 --> 05:32.450
H-How about this?

05:32.450 --> 05:35.280
I can't believe it! This is great, too!

05:35.280 --> 05:36.590
K-Kasahara-san...

05:36.590 --> 05:38.720
More! Show me more!

05:36.590 --> 05:38.930
See, even Kasahara-san sees it.

05:38.930 --> 05:40.250
Nishimura-san's cute.

05:39.710 --> 05:41.330
Good! I can't get enough!

05:40.250 --> 05:42.360
No, she means the cat!

05:41.330 --> 05:43.080
More! Don't you have any more?!

05:45.490 --> 05:48.480
Well, summer vacation starts next week,

05:48.490 --> 05:52.990
<b>Summer Vacation</b>

05:48.790 --> 05:52.980
so today, you'll all be making 
agendas for the break.

05:53.650 --> 05:55.030
Let's go to the pool!

05:55.790 --> 05:57.840
When's the summer festival again?

05:56.860 --> 05:58.090
I can't wait!

05:57.430 --> 05:58.980
That looks so cute!

05:58.080 --> 05:59.830
The festival is a must for sure.

06:00.160 --> 06:03.550
On this day, I'll first go to the museum...

06:03.550 --> 06:05.910
Kasahara-san, are you gonna 
go on a family trip?

06:05.910 --> 06:08.510
Hmm, I'm not sure.

06:17.370 --> 06:18.900
I'll get you a souvenir.

06:18.900 --> 06:21.260
What do you want? A phone strap?

06:22.930 --> 06:25.360
<i>A summer vacation agenda...</i>

06:27.110 --> 06:29.520
<i>I'll visit family graves for Obon.</i>

06:29.950 --> 06:33.120
<i>And go shopping with Dad.</i>

06:32.610 --> 06:36.450
Hey, keep the sixth free! 
Let's go to the beach!

06:36.450 --> 06:38.520
What about an amusement park?

06:39.140 --> 06:40.780
<i>I'm done...</i>

06:42.640 --> 06:45.760
Huh? You finish already, Nishimura-san?

06:45.760 --> 06:47.150
Lemme see, lemme see!

06:49.240 --> 06:52.300
N-No! Don't look!

06:53.590 --> 06:54.820
Oh...

07:01.540 --> 07:02.710
Sorry.

07:18.160 --> 07:25.130
<i>I thought the break would be nice because
 I don't have to see anyone from school.</i>

07:21.750 --> 07:27.000
<b>Summer Vacation Agenda</b>\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h
 <b>Class:</b> 5-1\h\h\h\h<b>Name:</b> Nishimura Akane

Shopping\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\hVisit graves\h\h\h
Obon\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h

07:32.610 --> 07:35.840
<i>Classes are already over. 
I should get going...</i>

07:40.650 --> 07:41.660
Oh!

07:41.660 --> 07:42.470
Huh?!

07:44.550 --> 07:47.700
Um... I, uh...

07:49.740 --> 07:52.150
So you were still here, Nishimura-san!

07:52.150 --> 07:53.580
Headed home now?

07:54.780 --> 07:56.880
What've you been doing all this time?

07:57.570 --> 08:00.300
I-I was... you know...

08:00.800 --> 08:04.780
A-And why are you here so late, Takada-kun?

08:04.780 --> 08:06.180
Well, you see...

08:06.180 --> 08:08.910
Sensei was fussing at me until just now.

08:08.910 --> 08:12.270
"You need to take your agenda 
more seriously," he said.

08:13.270 --> 08:15.730
I have to make a new one by tomorrow.

08:17.720 --> 08:21.320
<i>What kind of agenda did he even make?</i>

08:24.960 --> 08:27.430
You know, my spare umbrella broke.

08:27.440 --> 08:28.570
<b>Takada</b>

08:28.970 --> 08:30.560
I don't have one either.

08:31.070 --> 08:33.930
Think I'll be fine if I just sprint home?

08:33.930 --> 08:36.450
Takada-kun, um...

08:36.450 --> 08:38.560
Sorry about earlier.

08:38.850 --> 08:39.900
For what?

08:40.600 --> 08:45.290
It was because I didn't have 
a lot of plans on my agenda.

08:46.120 --> 08:48.670
If you're still okay with it...

08:48.670 --> 08:49.810
wanna see it?

08:50.300 --> 08:51.120
Yeah!

08:53.080 --> 08:54.430
You're right!

08:54.770 --> 08:56.840
There's barely anything on here.

08:56.840 --> 08:57.920
That's right...

08:58.790 --> 09:00.630
I'm so glad!

09:00.630 --> 09:01.420
What?

09:01.750 --> 09:05.940
This means we can play lots, Nishimura-san!

09:07.640 --> 09:11.770
Y-You want to? You want to play together?

09:11.770 --> 09:12.890
Of course!

09:13.370 --> 09:17.200
In fact, let's think of plans together!

09:18.570 --> 09:20.740
I recommend exploring!

09:20.740 --> 09:25.100
And then there's the mountains, 
fireworks, catching bugs...

09:25.100 --> 09:26.700
Also, the mountains!

09:27.300 --> 09:32.860
There's all sorts of stuff to do and 
places to go for summer vacation!

09:33.360 --> 09:37.550
If I'm with you, it'll be fun
 no matter where we go!

09:38.100 --> 09:41.120
W-Wait, do you not want to?

09:41.120 --> 09:44.690
N-No, that's not it at all.

09:45.660 --> 09:50.030
I... want to play with 
you as well, Takada-kun.

09:50.730 --> 09:52.480
What a relief!

09:52.480 --> 09:55.830
I'll put it on your agenda, too, then.

09:56.180 --> 09:58.390
Let's see... "Mountains"!

09:58.390 --> 10:00.320
<i>He's dead-set on the mountains.</i>

10:00.320 --> 10:02.240
<b>Summer Vacation Agenda   Class: 5-1</b>

10:01.310 --> 10:02.250
Ah!

10:02.250 --> 10:06.340
Grr... I can't write at all here.

10:06.340 --> 10:08.340
O-Of course not.

10:09.530 --> 10:11.460
And the rain's not letting up.

10:11.460 --> 10:14.080
I wanted to fill out our agendas...

10:14.730 --> 10:19.950
Ah, wait... Th-The school library 
might still be open.

10:20.890 --> 10:23.550
Even though class ended a while ago?

10:23.550 --> 10:26.050
Y-You're right...

10:26.050 --> 10:27.780
The teachers would get mad.

10:32.150 --> 10:34.260
It'll be okay, Nishimura-san.

10:34.260 --> 10:36.030
As long as we're home before curfew.

10:36.030 --> 10:39.290
If any teachers show up, 
we can hide under the desk!

10:39.290 --> 10:41.290
H-Hide under the desk?!

10:42.780 --> 10:46.090
How exciting! It's like we're 
doing something we shouldn't be!

10:57.140 --> 10:59.150
Looks like there's no one here.

11:01.620 --> 11:04.770
I've never been in the 
library all by myself!

11:04.770 --> 11:06.600
Takada-kun, shh!

11:06.600 --> 11:08.150
Sorry, sorry.

11:14.370 --> 11:17.090
It's kind of like we're exploring.

11:17.090 --> 11:18.640
Y-Yeah.

11:19.370 --> 11:22.460
It's hard to decide with 
so much we could do.

11:23.540 --> 11:30.030
I... want to do what you're doing
together with you.

11:30.030 --> 11:34.190
Me, too! I wanna do what you wanna do!

11:38.130 --> 11:41.670
Um... First, there's finding monsters.

11:41.670 --> 11:43.840
And taking ghost photos.

11:43.840 --> 11:46.090
We can make a secret base, too!

11:46.440 --> 11:49.980
Won't you be scolded for not
 taking this seriously again?

11:49.980 --> 11:51.090
You think?

11:52.450 --> 11:53.610
<i>I see.</i>

11:53.610 --> 11:55.830
<i>The point of making plans together...</i>

11:56.860 --> 11:59.710
<i>is to make promises
 to do things with each other.</i>

