12:11.540 --> 12:13.910
Should we go around the world as well?!

12:11.540 --> 12:17.540
<b>Around the World
Global Guide</b>

12:13.910 --> 12:16.290
No, I don't think that's...

12:35.720 --> 12:37.030
Sheesh...

12:37.030 --> 12:39.240
It's long past time to go home, you know.

12:47.620 --> 12:49.450
He sure did lecture us!

12:49.450 --> 12:50.730
Sorry.

12:50.730 --> 12:53.860
It's all because I said we 
should go to the library.

12:55.300 --> 13:00.430
We'll need to add "hide and seek training"
 to our summer vacation agendas.

13:08.800 --> 13:10.170
Nishimura-san!

13:11.130 --> 13:14.550
Let's play lots and lots 
during summer vacation!

13:20.020 --> 13:25.030
My <b>Clueless</b> First Friend

13:20.020 --> 13:25.030
Have fun -Sensei{red text}

13:27.080 --> 13:29.540
Er, and so, kids...

13:29.540 --> 13:34.420
Make sure to stay healthy, 
don't go too wild,

13:34.420 --> 13:38.410
and have yourselves a 
fruitful summer vacation.

13:39.430 --> 13:41.560
Summer vacation's gonna be so much fun.

13:41.560 --> 13:43.610
Remember our promise to go to the pool?

13:43.610 --> 13:44.420
Yeah.

13:45.720 --> 13:48.420
<i>Summer vacation begins tomorrow.</i>

13:49.970 --> 13:51.110
Akane.

13:51.810 --> 13:55.600
You're just going to 
the free pool at school, right?

13:55.600 --> 13:56.920
Well, yes...

13:56.940 --> 14:01.860
Let's Go to the Beach{left}

13:56.940 --> 14:01.860
Swimsuit Sale{right}

13:57.170 --> 13:59.740
Can't you just wear your school swimsuit?

13:59.740 --> 14:01.860
N-No!

14:01.860 --> 14:04.160
The school regulation swimsuits...

14:05.160 --> 14:07.320
You know, Hino-kun was saying...

14:07.830 --> 14:12.520
it might be kinda dorky to wear school 
swimsuits now that we're in fifth grade.

14:12.520 --> 14:13.330
Yeah.

14:13.810 --> 14:16.580
I'll have to buy a new one, then!

14:18.030 --> 14:21.080
I'm in fifth grade now.

14:22.120 --> 14:24.680
I'll stand out in a school swimsuit.

14:25.240 --> 14:26.340
I understand.

14:26.910 --> 14:29.980
It's rare that you ask for things like this.

14:29.980 --> 14:31.340
Thanks.

14:31.780 --> 14:33.820
What about this one? It's cute.

14:33.820 --> 14:36.710
N-No, that one's way too bright!

14:36.710 --> 14:37.940
How about this, then?

14:37.940 --> 14:40.360
I-I'm fine with something plainer...

14:40.360 --> 14:41.900
Something normal!

14:41.900 --> 14:43.730
It doesn't have to be cute!

14:43.730 --> 14:44.900
Huh?

14:44.900 --> 14:47.440
Then why not just your school swimsuit?

14:47.440 --> 14:49.050
N-No way!

14:49.050 --> 14:50.750
I won't fit in that way.

14:55.790 --> 14:57.860
Going through her defiant phase, huh?

15:17.710 --> 15:19.760
Akane, have you decided?

15:19.760 --> 15:21.480
I-I need a little more time!

15:28.860 --> 15:31.610
<b>Ramune</b>

15:28.860 --> 15:31.610
<b>Ramune</b>

15:44.250 --> 15:48.080
<i>No one's wearing their school suit after all.</i>

15:48.920 --> 15:52.660
<i>Good thing I bought a new one.</i>

15:52.660 --> 15:58.220
<i>I'd stand out in a school swimsuit, 
but they'll tease me if I wear a cute one.</i>

15:58.520 --> 16:02.190
<i>It's a tough balancing act
 for the Grim Reaper.</i>

16:02.620 --> 16:05.070
<i>What will Takada-kun say?</i>

16:06.050 --> 16:08.490
Ah! There you are, Nishimura-san!

16:10.360 --> 16:12.280
T-T-Takada-kun!

16:12.280 --> 16:13.960
I was looking for you.

16:13.960 --> 16:15.840
Let's get going, Nishimura-san.

16:16.200 --> 16:17.710
Hold on a second.

16:21.220 --> 16:25.270
<i>M-My swimsuit... doesn't 
look weird, does it?</i>

16:37.820 --> 16:39.110
Huh...

16:39.570 --> 16:40.730
Eh? Wait!

16:40.730 --> 16:42.590
Wh-Why the long pause?

16:42.590 --> 16:43.970
Is it weird?

16:44.820 --> 16:46.920
It's fine, Nishimura-san.

16:47.310 --> 16:49.090
C'mon, let's hurry up!

16:49.090 --> 16:50.440
O-Okay...

16:53.450 --> 16:55.260
<i>Maybe I messed up.</i>

16:57.090 --> 17:01.430
<i>Maybe they'll all think
 the Grim Reaper is trying too hard...</i>

17:02.540 --> 17:05.530
<i>I should have picked a plainer swimsuit...</i>

17:07.840 --> 17:09.390
Hey, check it out!

17:10.450 --> 17:13.760
The Grim Reaper's wearing 
an absurdly cute swimsuit!

17:14.500 --> 17:16.860
Hey, you're here, too, Kitagawa-kun!

17:17.510 --> 17:18.710
<i>Just ignore him...</i>

17:19.480 --> 17:23.850
Isn't it illegal for the Grim Reaper
 to wear a cute swimsuit?

17:25.190 --> 17:26.050
See?

17:26.280 --> 17:29.280
Kitagawa-kun also thinks you're 
so cute, it should be illegal!

17:29.580 --> 17:31.430
I was trying to be mean!

17:33.930 --> 17:36.140
<i>Kitagawa-kun... </i>also<i> thinks that?</i>

17:37.280 --> 17:41.230
<i>Does that mean that Takada-kun...</i>

17:42.120 --> 17:45.570
You always take things way 
too positively, you know!

17:45.960 --> 17:47.660
I-In what way?

17:47.660 --> 17:48.630
Listen up!

17:48.630 --> 17:50.090
I was teasing her!

17:50.410 --> 17:53.430
I meant that swimsuit doesn't 
look good on Nishimura!

17:53.920 --> 17:58.280
So you like the school-issued 
swimsuits better, Kitagawa-kun?

17:58.280 --> 18:00.640
Just how did you come to that conclusion?!

18:00.640 --> 18:05.380
Gross! Kitagawa likes girls 
in school swimsuits!

18:05.380 --> 18:06.910
What a freak.

18:06.910 --> 18:09.620
Hey! Y-You've got it all wrong!

18:09.620 --> 18:13.050
I mean, I don't even care 
what suits girls wear!

18:13.050 --> 18:14.810
I get you, Kitagawa-kun.

18:15.310 --> 18:18.840
You just can't help but admire
 whatever they wear!

18:18.840 --> 18:20.560
Stop that, Takada!

18:20.910 --> 18:23.060
Don't make me out to 
be even more of a freak!

18:23.060 --> 18:24.390
Just drop it.

18:24.390 --> 18:26.850
You can't win with that guy.

18:26.850 --> 18:28.220
Dang it!

18:28.750 --> 18:30.880
Argh, now I'm mad!

18:30.880 --> 18:32.580
Stop laughing at me!

18:32.580 --> 18:34.380
Don't take it out on me!

18:35.030 --> 18:36.390
There they go.

18:37.500 --> 18:38.460
Oh!

18:38.460 --> 18:40.220
Hino-kun's here, too!

18:40.930 --> 18:43.380
Hey! Over here!

18:43.380 --> 18:47.280
<i>You just can't help but admire
 whatever they wear!</i>

18:48.170 --> 18:50.790
<i>Does that mean he...</i>

18:51.430 --> 18:53.660
<i>No, he didn't mean me.</i>

18:53.660 --> 18:56.090
<i>I'm just standing out for trying too hard.</i>

18:56.910 --> 18:58.290
<i>How embarrassing...</i>

18:58.870 --> 19:00.550
Oh yeah, Nishimura-san.

19:00.550 --> 19:00.980
Huh?

19:01.740 --> 19:05.000
That swimsuit is really cute.

19:05.000 --> 19:06.330
You totally look great in it.

19:12.870 --> 19:15.330
I forgot to tell you before!

19:17.160 --> 19:19.920
Th-Thanks.

19:21.360 --> 19:23.880
They were selling ramune outside.

19:23.880 --> 19:26.080
Wow, you bought us some?!

19:26.080 --> 19:27.220
Thanks!

19:28.140 --> 19:28.930
Yo.

19:29.830 --> 19:31.540
Here, Nishimura.

19:31.540 --> 19:33.610
Huh? For me, too?

19:34.780 --> 19:36.140
Thank you.

19:37.030 --> 19:41.210
Wait, Hino-kun, is that the 
standard school swimsuit?

19:41.210 --> 19:42.020
Yep.

19:42.020 --> 19:45.340
I figured the dorkiness might 
loop around to being cool again.

19:45.340 --> 19:48.340
What?! Then why'd I buy a new one?!

19:52.320 --> 19:53.070
Take this!

19:53.070 --> 19:54.250
Stop that!

19:56.020 --> 19:57.170
Yay!

19:56.280 --> 19:57.530
There!

20:01.110 --> 20:04.290
Nishimura-san, come join us!

20:07.360 --> 20:10.970
<i>I'm glad I asked for this swimsuit.</i>

21:48.450 --> 21:51.590
Y-You look like you're 
having fun, Takada-kun.

21:51.590 --> 21:53.650
Taking detours is fun!

21:53.650 --> 21:55.040
And you're with me, too!

21:55.540 --> 21:57.030
Th-That's not...

21:57.370 --> 21:59.950
You're always so cool about things.

21:59.950 --> 22:01.760
It's great to smile, too, you know!

22:05.160 --> 22:06.970
She's so creepy when she smiles.

22:07.680 --> 22:11.170
Did you know? When the Grim Reaper smiles...

22:11.440 --> 22:16.750
I-I don't really like the way
 I look when I smile.

22:16.750 --> 22:18.730
Huh, really?

22:19.980 --> 22:23.200
It's true you're super cute when you smile.

22:23.690 --> 22:24.730
What?!

22:25.060 --> 22:27.850
Even though you're usually 
so awesome and stoic.

22:27.850 --> 22:30.660
No, no, no, I don't think that's true!

22:31.180 --> 22:33.370
Nishimura-san, you're awesome!

22:33.370 --> 22:35.100
You're the Grim Reaper, after all!

22:35.720 --> 22:39.410
N-No, not that part.

22:39.850 --> 22:46.500
I've been meaning to say this, 
but I'm just creepy and not cute at all...

22:46.500 --> 22:49.130
Well, you <i>are</i> usually the stoic type.

22:49.880 --> 22:52.070
<i>S-Stoic type?</i>

22:53.580 --> 22:55.840
Wait, are you worried?

22:55.840 --> 23:00.060
About ruining your stoic image 
by showing off your smile?

23:00.610 --> 23:02.820
<i>No, that's never crossed my mind.</i>

23:03.540 --> 23:05.010
It's all right.

23:06.380 --> 23:08.730
I'll always be on your side!

23:09.490 --> 23:15.070
I would never come to dislike you!

23:15.760 --> 23:18.300
I don't care even if you stop being stoic!

23:18.300 --> 23:20.820
You can smile as much as you want!

23:21.280 --> 23:24.790
Y-Yeah... Thank you.

23:28.960 --> 23:30.230
Thank you.

23:30.230 --> 23:32.740
Huh? Why'd you say it twice?

23:35.010 --> 23:40.020
<b>Next time...</b>

23:35.010 --> 23:40.020
<b>Grandma's House</b>
